sue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### What version of gRPC are you using?\r\nmaster (878cea23105641ab36ceb688af326139cf60b842)\r\n\r\n### What version of Go are you using (`go version`)?\r\n`go version go1.17 linux/amd64`\r\n\r\n### What operating system (Linux, Windows, …) and version?\r\n`Ubuntu 16.04.7 LTS`\r\n\r\n### What did you do?\r\nBy inserting couple of `time.Sleep` calls inside grpc code to force a certain execution order, I can repro a nil pointer deref panic that is happening in production for us. Please see here for a repro test: https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/compare/master...entombedvirus:pickfirst-panic-demo?expand=1\r\n\r\n### What did you expect to see?\r\npickfirst balancer should not panic.\r\n\r\n### What did you see instead?\r\npanics.\r\n```\r\npanic: runtime error: invalid memory address or nil pointer dereference\r\n[signal SIGSEGV: segmentation violation code=0x1 addr=0x18 pc=0x7f974c]\r\n\r\ngoroutine 22 [running]:\r\ngoogle.golang.org/grpc.(*pickfirstBalancer).ExitIdle(0xc00027e7b0)\r\n        /home/rravi/work/grpc-go/pickfirst.go:131 +0x6c\r\ngoogle.golang.org/grpc.(*ccBalancerWrapper).watcher(0xc000180730)\r\n        /home/rravi/work/grpc-go/balancer_conn_wrappers.go:102 +0x3cd\r\ncreated by google.golang.org/grpc.newCCBalancerWrapper\r\n        /home/rravi/work/grpc-go/balancer_conn_wrappers.go:67 +0x246\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Notes\r\nThe simplest way to fix this  seems to be check if b.sc is nil before calling b.sc.Connect here: https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/blob/master/pickfirst.go#L128-L130 but wasn't sure if the panic is symptomatic of a more fundamental issue re: how state is managed.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you would like me to open a PR with that fix / anything else or if grpc team want to implement the fix internally.","closed_by":{"login":"dfawley","id":26072277,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDcyMjc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26072277?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley","html_url":"https://github.com/dfawley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/4965/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/4965/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}